        <mxCell id="legend-content" value="&lt;b&gt;Objects:&lt;/b&gt; Rectangles represent instances of classes/components&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Links:&lt;/b&gt; Lines show relationships and communication paths between objects&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Messages:&lt;/b&gt; Numbered labels on links show the sequence of method calls/messages&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sequence:&lt;/b&gt; Numbers indicate temporal order (1, 2, 3... → 6.1, 7, 8...)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sub-messages:&lt;/b&gt; Decimal notation (6.1) shows messages within the same context&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scenario:&lt;/b&gt; Student creates a container → System selects device → Saves to database → Sends command to agent → Docker creates container" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
